      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/ExternalAccess/FirmOutcomeEndpoints.cs</file>
      <file>tests/CLAUDE.md</file>
    </files>
  </knowledge>
  <notes>
    Completed 2026-11-20, merged into work 6b84fb1db1 (branch task/ebilling-130g, tip ffb384c1e9). FirmOutcome.NoticeProse: the stored prose of the invoice own submission, Rejected / ReturnedToFirm only, matching kind and version, re-screened on every read; a read fault omits only the field. Both outcome routes carry it. Opus adversarial review: no F1/F3/F4; F2 reader/writer tie (shared SentNoticeVersion, real-writer round-trip tests), F2 routine SubmissionRejected mismatch logged at Information, K1 lone-surrogate catch: fixed. uac-r2 PASS; N1 wording and N2 submission-route cases fixed. Known limits (HTML-shaped prose, the extra read, source unfiltered): notes/130g-firm-view-notice-prose.md; task 134 renders the field as plain text. Filtered tests 1221/0, ArchTests 638/0, build 0 warnings, publish +1,102 bytes against ff496f2aa0.
    rework: fix-round-1 task 130g
  </notes>

